@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] local-pbr-patch-is-opt-in
The Bevy PBR patch MUST preserve unmarked views and retain upstream licenses and source provenance. Forward-motion
comparison views MUST keep the original prepass and TAA inputs until their motion output and temporal edge quality
have been validated. Shader output fields, render targets, view bindings and dynamic offsets MUST use one mode key.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture] dependency-patch-has-one-copy
The patched PBR crate MUST be selected through the project-local Cargo patch. Runtime and exporter builds MUST NOT
read or modify a shared registry source or require a dependency checkout outside this game. Upstream feature-gated
library and shader files MAY remain together, with their purpose documented in the vendor README.
